//! Definition-driven construction with explicitly named handwritten semantic services.
//! Whole documents add bounded parser postprocessing and linking; raw grammar
//! fragments preserve parsing-only construction. The operand append adapter is
//! one shared dependency within this pipeline.
//! Ecore supplies types, flags, enum domains and reciprocal stored ownership.
//! Appending creates ParameterMembership -> Feature -> FeatureValue -> Expression.
//! This is NOT the derived InstantiationExpression.argument algorithm or a
//! mutable/readable operand list. Function binding and control-function bodies
//! require separate semantics.
